ost knowing of who fears Him.","j":27,"h":53,"s":53,"a":32,"sd":null},{"k":"53:33","t":"Have you seen the one who turned away","j":27,"h":53,"s":53,"a":33,"sd":null},{"k":"53:34","t":"And gave a little and [then] refrained?","j":27,"h":53,"s":53,"a":34,"sd":null},{"k":"53:35","t":"Does he have knowledge of the unseen, so he sees?","j":27,"h":53,"s":53,"a":35,"sd":null},{"k":"53:36","t":"Or has he not been informed of what was in the scriptures of Moses","j":27,"h":53,"s":53,"a":36,"sd":null},{"k":"53:37","t":"And [of] Abraham, who fulfilled [his obligations] -","j":27,"h":53,"s":53,"a":37,"sd":null},{"k":"53:38","t":"That no bearer of burdens will bear the burden of another","j":27,"h":53,"s":53,"a":38,"sd":null},{"k":"53:39","t":"And that there is not for man except that [good] for which he strives","j":27,"h":53,"s":53,"a":39,"sd":null},{"k":"53:40","t":"And that his effort is going to be seen -","j":27,"h":53,"s":53,"a":40,"sd":null},{"k":"53:41","t":"Then he will be recompensed for it with the fullest recompense -","j":27,"h":53,"s":53,"a":41,"sd":null},{"k":"53:42","t":"And that to your Lord is the finality","j":27,"h":53,"s":53,"a":42,"sd":null},{"k":"53:43","t":"And that it is He who makes [one] laugh and weep","j":27,"h":53,"s":53,"a":43,"sd":null},{"k":"53:44","t":"And that it is He who causes death and gives life","j":27,"h":53,"s":53,"a":44,"sd":null}],"juz":27,"hizb":53,"surahs":[53],"sajdah":false}